The legal text is the Constitution and statutes of Texas as published by the Texas Legislative Council at https://statutes.capitol.texas.gov/. Statutes are not copyrightable (Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, Inc., 590 U.S. 255 (2020)); no annotations are taken. The text is republished unaltered in its wording, with credit to the Texas Legislative Council as its publisher.

The arrangement of this repository, its tables, commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be reused under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This repository is not legal advice
and not an official publication.
